%% section: Failover without split brain
%% caption: Failover and the fencing that prevents split brain
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Monitor
    participant P as Old primary
    participant R as Replica
    participant VIP as Traffic director
    M->>P: health check fails
    M->>R: how far behind are you?
    R-->>M: lag = the data about to be lost
    alt lag within RPO
        M->>P: fence — STONITH or revoke its lease
        Note over P: fencing first. Promoting without it is how you get two primaries
        M->>R: promote
        M->>VIP: point writes at the new primary
    else lag too large
        M->>M: hold and escalate — failing over would lose committed writes
    end
